### Créer un événement limité

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Formation Spring Boot",
  "description": "Apprendre à créer des API robustes.",
  "eventDate": "2026-11-20",
  "eventTime": "14:30:00",
  "location": "Salle Info 1",
  "category": "CONFERENCE",
  "maxCapacity": 2,
  "organizer": {
    "id": 1
  }
}
###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Securite",
  "email": "test.secu@student.uemf.ma",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}
###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "event": {
    "id": 1
  }
  
}

